tags: party_affairs

= Choosing our enemies

In our media and campaign materials, who should we consider as our main opponents?

[? if enemies != 0 : Previously, we had considered the [+ enemies +] as our prior enemies. Is a change of direction necessary? ?]

- @right: fdp/cdu/afd
- @far_right: afd
- @left: spd/greens
- @establishment: establishment (spd/greens/fdp/cdu)
- @noenemy: thorfinnmaxxing
- @easy_discard

@right
on-arrival: enemies = "right-wing parties"; beweli_strength += 4; emali_strength += 4; pragmatist_dissent += 1; urban_cdu -= 1; urban_afd -= 1; youth_cdu -= 1; youth_afd -= 1; youth_linke += 1*(1-dissent); urban_linke += 1*(1-dissent); pro_status_quo -= 1; cdu_relation -= 2;

@far_right
on-arrival: enemies = "far right AfD"; pro_status_quo += 1; pragmatist_strength += 2; urban_linke += (afd_votes/10)*(1-dissent); youth_linke += (afd_votes/10)*(1-dissent); beweli_dissent += 1; rural_afd += (100-afd_votes)/100; cdu_relation += 4;

@left
on-arrival: enemies = "moderate left parties"; oldleft_strength += 5; oldleft_dissent -= 2; beweli_strength += 1; emali_dissent += 2; pragmatist_dissent += 5; pro_status_quo -= 6*(1-dissent); youth_linke += 3*(1-dissent); youth_spd -= 1*(1-dissent); youth_greens += 1*(1-dissent); econ_moderation -= 1; foreign_moderation -= 1; bsw_relation += 4; greens_relation -= 6; spd_relation -= 6;

@establishment
on-arrival: enemies = "entire establishment"; oldleft_strength += 3; oldleft_dissent -= 1; beweli_strentgh += 3; pragmatist_dissent += 4; emali_dissent += 1; pro_status_quo -= 10*(1-dissent); youth_linke += 2*(1-dissent); east_linke += 1*(1-dissent); greens_relation -= 4; spd_relation -= 4; cdu_relation -= 2;

@noenemy
on-arrival: beweli_dissent += 2; emali_dissent += 2; oldleft_dissent += 3; greens_relation += 2; spd_relation += 2; cdu_relation += 2; pro_status_quo += 5;
